    {
      "id": "id-page-omni-unstated-roast",
      "split": "dev",
      "tags": ["page", "inference"],
      "why": "'Omni roast' with no stated roast level. roastedFor is omni; the roast level must be left empty, or marked inferred and flagged for the user.",
